/S /P
/P 324 0 R
/E (Interestingly, Einstein's equations of general relativity do not specify which way time must run; they don't distinguish between the past and the future. To bridge the gap between a black hole and a white hole, space and time must pass through the quantum zone, however many physicists like Carlo Rovelli argue that this process violates Einstein's equations, even if just for a very small quantity of time. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
