<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 328 0 R
/E (The slogan "Just Tax Land" functions as a powerful rhetorical signal of movement identity, yet it often obscures the complex economic trade-offs and institutional barriers that determine whether such a policy can actually solve modern structural crises.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
