/E (IHere is a number that doesn't make sense the first time you hear it: 1%. That's roughly the fraction of your DNA that codes for proteins - the molecules that build tissues, catalyse reactions, carry signals, and keep you alive. Which raises an obvious question:)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [3]
>>
